     Device-wide carrier defaults read by the AOSP CarrierConfig app
     (DefaultCarrierConfigService, res/xml/vendor.xml). The app merges this
     file after its per-carrier assets, so these values win over them. Values
     follow the stock FP6 carrier-config app (com.fp.customercarrierconfig
     res/xml/vendor.xml):
     - VoLTE on for every carrier (the unfiltered stock block).
     - Emergency calls: the stock unfiltered block sets
       carrier_use_ims_first_for_emergency_bool=false (the AOSP default is
       true); the stock carrier blocks below set it back to true for 38
       carriers (carrier id or MCC/MNC, as in stock). Only this key is copied
       from the stock carrier blocks.
     VoWiFi and video calling stay off: their stacks are not installed.
-->
